Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: hook 0217 alive wild Pokemon (solid, A/bump/charge
 battle, ambient flyers)

0110 block v3: SS3DS_WildSolid / SS3DS_WildTalk / SS3DS_WildBirdPick in encounter_check.c, bold (charging) mood, flyer tick and draw (texture slot 7) in fieldmap_native.c, all behind P3DS_WildVisCfg(5) (wild_vis_alive). 0217_wildalive.py adds the call sites once: FieldInput_Update drops the walk keys when a visible one is in the way, FieldInput_Process starts its battle on A / bump / charge, and forced battles take land/water from the visible one. Optional hook (logs skipped).
